*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE] Automation of Feature 5GC001013 sub-feature A
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope :
...               1/ Setup enDcStatus different values on WebUI, reach the cell setup and check if the modification is taken into account
...                  in L2_PS_Cell_Setup
...               2/ Setup Gap different configurations with Addtion Request and check X2ap/F1ap call flow + check Gaps in Sherpa logs
...               3/ Setup Gap different configurations with Modification Request and check X2ap/F1ap call flow + check Gaps in Sherpa logs
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation author : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation contact: loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 28-Feb-2020
...               Modified Date               : 28-Jun-2022
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@Nokia.com -- Modification for TCP/MCShark
...               Modified Date               : 08-Mar-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Modify KW Set enDcSyncStatus due to issue with chaining several tests
...                                                                     Modify Test Teardown to restore original gNB SCF at end of each test
...               Modified Date               : 13-Oct-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Remove of Tags
...               Modified Date               : 28-Nov-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Remove Sherpa logs processing and replace it with TTI logs processing
...               Modified Date               : 19-Dec-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Regroup tests into 2 new tests
...               Modified Date               : 29-Jan-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Refactoring 1013-A021
...               \nModification: 12/04/2024 - vincent.boulet@nokia.com - Parity testing to introduce dRNIC RINLINE2 CLOUD_5GC_dRNIC_1vDU_P_AP_LO_DC

