*** Keywords ***
TC 1013 enDcSyncStatus
    [Documentation]                 Generic test for 5GC001013_A :
    ...                             1/ Modification of enDcSyncStatus parameter on gNB cOAM WebUI
    ...                             2/ Check enDcSyncStatus value in L2_PS_Cell_Setup
    [Arguments]                     ${param}
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Step                            Test Name Display
    Step                            Set enDcSyncStatus
    Step                            Start CPRT Capture                          depends=Set enDcSyncStatus
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_CPRT}
    Step                            Setup WTS                                   depends=Start CPRT Capture
    Step                            Stop Capture                                depends=Setup WTS
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_CPRT}
    Step                            Check enDcSyncStatus                        depends=Stop Capture
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_CPRT}
    [Teardown]                      Teardown 1013 enDcSyncStatus

Teardown 1013 enDcSyncStatus
    ${message}=  Evaluate  "\\033[44mTest Teardown\\033[0m"
    BuiltIn.Log      ${message}   console=yes
    [Teardown]                      GenericTest.Display diagnosis
    Teardown 1013

TC 1013 Add GAP Setup
    [Documentation]                 Generic test for 5GC001013_A :
    ...                             1/ Modification of enDcSyncStatus parameter on gNB cOAM WebUI
    ...                             2/ Setup Gap Measurements in case of SgNBAddtionRequest procedure
    ...                             3/ Check X2ap/F1ap call flow + MeasGapConfig in case of SgNBAddtionRequest/ACK procedure
    ...                             4/ Check Gaps in SFN + Slots from TTI logs
    [Arguments]                     ${param}
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Step                            Test Name Display
    Step                            Set enDcSyncStatus
    Step                            Setup WTS                                   depends=Set enDcSyncStatus
    Step                            4G UE Attach                                depends=Setup WTS
    Step                            Start Core Capture                          depends=4G UE Attach
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
    Step                            WTS GAP Setup                               depends=Start Core Capture
    Step                            5G UE Attach                                depends=WTS GAP Setup
    Step                            Stop Capture                                depends=5G UE Attach
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
    Step                            Start Traffic                               depends=Stop Capture
    Step                            Start TTI Capture                           depends=Start Traffic
    Step                            Wait TTI Capture                            depends=Start TTI Capture
    Step                            Stop TTI Capture                            depends=Wait TTI Capture
    Step                            Stop Traffic                                depends=Stop TTI Capture
    Step                            WTS GAP Release                             depends=Stop Traffic
    Step                            5G UE Modification                          depends=WTS GAP Release
    Step                            Check GAP Pattern Counter                   depends=5G UE Modification
    Step                            Check CU DU GAP Setup Flow                  depends=Check GAP Pattern Counter
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
    Step                            Check No Traffic During Interrupted Slot    depends=Check CU DU GAP Setup Flow
    [Teardown]                      Teardown 1013 Add GAP Setup

TC 1013 Mod GAP Setup
    [Documentation]                 Generic test for 5GC001013_A :
    ...                             1/ Setup Gap Measurements in case of SgNBModificationRequest procedure
    ...                             2/ Check X2ap/F1ap call flow + MeasGapConfig in case of SgNBModificationRequest/ACK procedure
